            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Unfortunately, the issue persists even when restarting Neovim and waiting for the parsers to install. In fact, even you open the `file.py` file several times, the error message is displayed each time.\n\nI am afraid I can not reproduce this (on Arch, but I don't think it should matter). Could you try executing `:checkhealth vim.treesitter nvim-treesitter` to see if it shows anything?\n\nAlso, are sure that the parser is installed cleanly? Do you have [necessary system dependencies installed](https://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter/tree/main?tab=readme-ov-file#requirements)? if you could screencast the whole process (including initial clean install of MiniMax), that would help here.",
